    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>Techfest, IIT Bombay, in association with Amazon Web Services (AWS), invites students to participate in the Campus to Cloud Hackathon.</p>\n<p>Develop and deploy a working solution to a real-world problem using AWS technologies.</p>\n<p><strong>Competition Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Prize Pool of ₹1,50,000 for the top 3 teams</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>1-year AWS Skill Builder Premium subscription</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Up to $30 in AWS credits</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>AWS Certification Exam Voucher worth $100</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>\n<div>Top 35 teams qualify for the final round at IIT Bombay during Techfest 2026&ndash;27.</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:</strong> Students aged 18+ enrolled in Indian educational institutions</p>\n<p><strong>Team Size:</strong> Individual or teams of up to 4 members</p>\n<p><strong>Submission Deadline:</strong> 30 November 2026, 11:59 PM</p>\n<p>The finalists will present their solutions before AWS and Techfest judges at IIT Bombay on 17 December 2026.</p>",
